pan><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><img data-key=\"1\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/088d-audiofreehighqps/45/CC/GAqhRAAOBv0HAAbOqQSpdR6S.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/088d-audiofreehighqps/45/CC/GAqhRAAOBv0HAAbOqQSpdR6S.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/088d-audiofreehighqps/45/CC/GAqhRAAOBv0HAAbOqQSpdR6S.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"750\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/088d-audiofreehighqps/45/CC/GAqhRAAOBv0HAAbOqQSpdR6S.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"140\"><br></p><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">时间轴：</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">04:30  在ICU，年轻人不如老人</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">09:00  ICU存活率接近90%</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">17:28  喝饮料太多生命垂危</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">20:00  无论如何，产妇不能死</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-